    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by 'letting go'? it just feels like im stuck in this limbo where i cant move forward and i cant go back. it's a constant, heavy ache. like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to feel this emptiness anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
