      "role": "user",
      "content": "coexist with it? how am i supposed to do that when it's so heavy? it feels less like \"coexisting\" and more like drowning. sometimes i look at the void and think... maybe the void is easier. maybe it's just more honest to just stop fighting it than to keep pretending i can fix this.",
